    "regime_notes": "Passed benchmark-wide absolute IC and ICIR gates across the 15-instrument universe. Strong recent 120/252/756/1260-session ICIR, but small cross-section implies conservative uncertainty. Five-day decay is weak while 20-day persistence is positive.",
    "thresholds": {"absolute_daily_paper_ic": 0.007, "absolute_daily_paper_icir": 0.084}
